---
import { site } from "../../data/site";
import SectionHeading from "../ui/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="section-shell border-b border-border" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8">
		<SectionHeading
			id="about-heading"
			eyebrow="About"
			title="Practical IT roots. Growing software craft."
			description="A concise look at where I’m coming from — and where I’m headed."
			align="split"
		/>

		<div class="mt-12 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-14">
			<aside class="reveal reveal-delay-1 relative">
				<div class="sticky top-24 rounded-[1.25rem] border border-border bg-surface-elevated/70 p-6 sm:p-8">
					<p class="font-display text-5xl font-bold leading-none tracking-tight text-accent sm:text-6xl">
						{site.brandMark}
					</p>
					<p class="mt-6 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
						Professional brand for {site.fullName} — an IT professional expanding into software
						development with curiosity, care and a builder’s mindset.
					</p>
					<dl class="mt-8 space-y-4 border-t border-border pt-6 text-sm">
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
							<dt class="text-ink-muted">Focus</dt>
							<dd class="text-right font-medium text-ink">IT → Software</dd>
						</div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
							<dt class="text-ink-muted">Approach</dt>
							<dd class="text-right font-medium text-ink">Learn by building</dd>
						</div>
						<div class="flex justify-between gap-4">
							<dt class="text-ink-muted">Career history</dt>
							<dd class="text-right">
								<a
									href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/brandon-njenga-13a88a1a0/"
									class="font-medium text-accent underline-offset-4 hover:underline"
									target="_blank"
									rel="noopener noreferrer"
								>
									LinkedIn
								</a>
							</dd>
						</div>
					</dl>
				</div>
			</aside>

			<div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-muted sm:text-lg">
				<p class="text-ink">
					I come from a Computer Science background and have spent meaningful time in IT support and
					technical operations — diagnosing issues, supporting users and keeping systems running
					smoothly.
				</p>
				<p>
					That day-to-day work sharpened how I think: listen carefully, isolate the problem, test
					assumptions and leave things better than I found them. Those habits transfer naturally into
					software development.
				</p>
				<p>
					I’m actively growing as a developer — writing more code, exploring modern web tools and
					building projects that help me turn concepts into working software. I enjoy troubleshooting,
					continuous learning and creating solutions that are genuinely useful.
				</p>
				<blockquote
					class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-5 font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-2xl"
				>
					Curious, practical and steadily building — one useful project at a time.
				</blockquote>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
